title: "Fluid Gas Planet: real-time gas giants with fluid simulation in WebGPU"
type: software
authors:
  - alias: elias-nero-tron
# Bei einem Umzug des Repos nur repository-code anpassen; der Autor bleibt.
repository-code: "https://github.com/elias-nero-tron/Fluid-Gas-Planet"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.2.2-unverified
date-released: 2026-09-25
keywords:
  - webgpu
  - wgsl
  - fluid simulation
  - stable fluids
  - gas giant
  - jupiter
  - procedural planet
  - cube sphere
abstract: >-
  Real-time rendering of gas giants without image textures: fluid simulation (Stable Fluids) on a
  cube-sphere grid, particle advection following the Gaseous Giganticus method, physically motivated
  jets, storms and lighting, entirely on the GPU in WebGPU/WGSL.
